t%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=91a708bf6ac6966a03a734af48bb177d", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/26816901/uploads/origins/39184016-7394-49e0-bf7e-46ddbac13b3b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=91a708bf6ac6966a03a734af48bb177d, https://si.imgix.net/26816901/uploads/origins/39184016-7394-49e0-bf7e-46ddbac13b3b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f1a8a90e69ac8f639b69e607ffb133e1 2x, https://si.imgix.net/26816901/uploads/origins/39184016-7394-49e0-bf7e-46ddbac13b3b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1d666d80d1cc4b673febcd198befc72e 3x"}, "body": "I really love your hypnosis situations! Especially this one: https://www.pixiv.net/en/artworks/98232322\nI love 良輔's first hypnotized face!\nI would like to request a continuation of it!\n\nSituation:\n良輔 brings his お兄さん to the storage room to be hypnotized by 先生. Instead of being hypnotized into a エッチな生徒 the big brother becomes a 催眠人形 to make 良輔 become more エッチ:\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1affDgu7OauAckP-ZND7Ktnc3YjiqxyTs?usp=sharing\nI made a prologue for the story but drawing just the main is fine!\n\n台詞：\n先「よくできました良輔！」\n良「ありがとう先生！あ！お兄ちゃんのちんちん大きい！おいしい！お兄ちゃんもエッチな生徒になって嬉しい！」\n先「え？エッチな生徒は良輔だけだよ！お前のお兄ちゃんはただの催眠人形だ。良輔をもっとエッチな生徒にするために生まれた催眠人形。そうでしょう、お兄～ちゃん」\n兄「はい、ご主人様…俺ははただの催眠人形です…良輔様をもっとエッチな生徒にするために生まれた催眠人形です…ご命令ください…」\n良「本当？！ありがとう先生！お兄ちゃん！いっぱいエッチなことしましょう！お兄ちゃんいって！」\n兄「はい、良輔様…催眠人形…射精します…」\nMy Japanese is bad so feel free to change!\n\n兄 is wearing a 学ラン. His character design is up to you!", "nc": 41, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@0du_cky0/works/12", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 173409, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f26f620b/uploads/origins/4e359b7c-d483-4de4-a3a3-